@baseUrl=http://localhost:8080
@apibaseUrl=http://localhost:8080/api/posts

### post list
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts

### post info
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/1

### post upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "title": "something",
  "content": "ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss",
  "author": 1
}

### post-2-upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "title": "something2",
  "content": "ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss",
  "author": 1
}

### post-update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "title": "something1-updated",
  "content": "updated",
  "author": 1
}


### post-delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/1

### post search
GET {{apibaseUrl}}?page=1&title=Title8

### post search
GET {{apibaseUrl}}?page=1&title=Title8&body=body of 8

### post search
GET {{apibaseUrl}}?page=1&title=Title8&writer=writer80

### post search
GET {{apibaseUrl}}?page=1&title=Title8&writedate=2026-03-05
